That all works nice, though it isn't necessary to keep a tinned troll
in your inventory.  Once it's tinned, it is no longer a going concern.
One other trick that I discovered was putting the corpse in a chest or
sack.  After a few hundred turns, the corpse rots away like a normal
corpse instead of regenerating.  I'm not sure how ice boxes would
work.  I'll have to test that.

Perhaps the dev team might want to fix that in the next version...
